{"verse_key": "10:69", "surah": 10, "verse": 69, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَفْتَرُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ٱلْكَذِبَ لَا يُفْلِحُونَ", "translation": "Say, \"Indeed, those who invent falsehood about Allāh will not succeed.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1550190, "verse_to_ms": 1559520, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 1550190, "end_ms": 1550780}, {"i": 1, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 1550780, "end_ms": 1551720}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1551720, "end_ms": 1552700}, {"i": 3, "text": "يَفْتَرُونَ", "start_ms": 1552700, "end_ms": 1553850}, {"i": 4, "text": "عَلَى", "start_ms": 1553850, "end_ms": 1554280}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 1554280, "end_ms": 1555120}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "start_ms": 1555120, "end_ms": 1555920}, {"i": 7, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1555920, "end_ms": 1556300}, {"i": 8, "text": "يُفْلِحُونَ", "start_ms": 1556300, "end_ms": 1559015}]}